    <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Prioritize width (32"+) for beginner stability.</li>
      <li>Ensure your kit includes a dual-action pump.</li>
      <li>Use a quick-release waist belt leash on rivers.</li>
    </ul>
